# Public base URL of the daily-data site published by the *server* repo
# (mrHumildad/cepdata → GitHub Pages, "deploy data site" workflow). The app
# fetches <base>/daily/index.json + <base>/daily/YYYY-MM-DD.json from it.
#
# Not a secret — it is a public URL — so it is committed here. Change it if you
# rename the server repo, and keep the client workflow's Pages deployment in
# sync.
#
# Unset/empty → the app falls back to same-origin <BASE_URL>/logic/daily/,
# which is how you work offline: copy the server's data/daily/ into
# public/logic/daily/.
#
# A local override goes in .env.local (gitignored).
VITE_DATA_BASE_URL=https://mrhumildad.github.io/cepdata/

# Basemap style URL (MapLibre). OpenFreeMap needs no API key and serves its
# tiles with `Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *`.
#
# The previous provider's dark style (Stadia's alidade_smooth_dark) is NOT
# usable here: its tiles now return 401 without an API key, which blanked the
# map on GitHub Pages while still working on localhost. Other keyless
# OpenFreeMap styles: liberty, bright, positron.
#
# Empty/unset → App.jsx falls back to the same OpenFreeMap dark style.
VITE_MAP_STYLE_URL=https://tiles.openfreemap.org/styles/dark
